188
00:12:46,660 --> 00:12:48,250
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Phiền phức hết chỗ nói.</font>

189
00:12:48,780 --> 00:12:52,740
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24"><i>TMPA13 RIKISHI Mark 3 xuất kích.</i></font>

